  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help floods victims in Nyalenda KENYA.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nyalenda community sits in Kisumu  county which is one of the 47 counties within Kenya. Nyalenda  has a population of around 100,000 people who lives in the slums and who lives below a dollar a day. Due to heavy rains this year most houses have been marooned in flood waters. The area has been experiencing  perennial  flooding and people have been displaced each and every year. The women and children and elderly living in the slums have been displaced hence needs urgent interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
